From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: IamMaxim <g.maxim.stepanoff@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 28 Jun 2026 23:05:37 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] brand: replace Zed with Zedium in agent prompts and remote
 server filenames

- System prompt templates: Zed coding agent -> Zedium coding agent
- Agent display name, ID, and menu entry: Zed Agent -> Zedium Agent
- Remote server binary/artifact names: zed-remote-server -> zedium-remote-server
